<title>POLAND: Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0035.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP fixes zloty down vs dlr at 3.0035.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland fixed the zloty at 3.0035 against the dollar, down from 3.0030 on Wednesday and at 1.8300 against the mark, down from 1.8295, the NBP said.</p>
<p>The NBP fixed the zloty 2.33 percent from the average weighted dollar and mark central parity rates, softer than yesterday's 2.40 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
